  <worksheets>
    <worksheet name='Drivers'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Housing affordability is now the second highest reason for seeking assistance</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>Reasons clients gave for seeking assistance, monthly, July 2017 – March 2026 (AIHW)</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>The number of clients citing housing affordability stress has grown steadily for years — the 12-month average rose every year since 2019 (+8 to +10% most years). The &quot;2nd highest&quot; ranking is very recent: this reason only overtook Housing crisis in January 2026, the final quarter of the data shown. The last month alone (Feb–Mar 2026) accounts for one of the largest single-month jumps in the whole series. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>*Data from July 2025 onward is preliminary and may be revised in future AIHW releases.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <repository-location derived-from='http://localhost:9100/workbooks/aihw_homeless_in_australia_review_August_2026/Drivers?rev=' id='132698416' path='/workbooks/aihw_homeless_in_australia_review_August_2026' revision='' />
